SkillDesc: {
	WaterLaserSKill:
		'''
		Hold to immediately channel a continuous water beam. Release to stop.
		Every {0} seconds, consumes {3} Magic Power and deals {1} Water damage, splashing other enemies near the beam's endpoint for {2}% damage.
		Deals {4:0.#}% damage to targets whose freeze cooldown is not active.
		Each hit reduces the target's freeze cooldown by 0.5 seconds.
		'''
	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
		Passive: Magic Missile ignores enemy defense. After hitting the same target 5 times consecutively, it deals splash damage equal to 200% of Magic Missile's damage to other nearby enemies (the main target is not affected).
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill:
		'''
		Summons a floating magic orb that follows you, up to {0} at a time.
		Each orb fires a Magic Missile at the nearest enemy, dealing {1} magic damage.
		'''
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		When enabled, Ashen Witch lets Elaina use [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power]. Its base maximum equals vanilla maximum mana, and each point of maximum life removed by Ashen Witch grants 1 additional maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power]. Her extra life gain is reduced by 50%. When [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] is insufficient, each 1% of maximum life restores 1% of maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power].
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] regenerates at a fixed combat rate, refills in about two seconds outside combat, and pauses for three seconds after taking damage. Mana potions do not restore it.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		Requires the Ashen Witch skill to be enabled.
		Activate the barrier just before taking damage. It reduces damage based on the life lost to Ashen Witch and consumes [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] equal to the damage blocked by the barrier.
		'''
	WindSlashSkill:
		'''
		Unleashes a piercing wind blade that deals {0} magic damage to every enemy in its path.
		Weaker enemies are knocked back along the blade's direction.
		'''
}

